==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
*10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
*15 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**10 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 6~8 seconds<sup>180f~240f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 10~12 seconds<sup>300f~360f</sup>.
**10 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 10~12 seconds<sup>300f~360f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 14~16 seconds<sup>420f~480f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Many [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies lay waiting in the base, but the stage remains somewhat passive before that. Stall against the Doge Darks and build up a slow army, making sure to save your [[Cat Cannon]]. After hitting the base, it's an all-out battle against a large force of Dark enemies. Bring plenty of meatshields and ranged attackers such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris]] to fight the enemies with. Once the Assassin Bear appears, fire the Cat Cannon to defeat him. After that, the stage should become fairly simple, but don't let your guard down, as the enemies don't stop spawning.

